            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>[0001]    A quick release assembly (12) for a bicycle wheel that includes a pair of heads (108,110) disposed at generally opposite ends of a skewer rod (93). One of the heads includes a cam surface that is translatable relative to the head. The quick release includes an operator (112) having a handle portion and a stem portion (146). The stem portion (146) includes a cam that cooperates with the cam surface formed in one of the heads such that operation of the handle alters the distance between the heads from a first orientation wherein the heads secure a wheel to a bicycle, a second orientation wherein the heads loosely secure the wheel to the bicycle and a third orientation wherein the wheel assembly can be freely removed from the bicycle.</p>
            </abstract>
